  "body": "I am working with a device interface with CP2110 chip\nWhen i try to get data from InputReportEvent. In mac with Chrome, it work fine, the data is in variable length base on data to report\nBut when i test the same code in Window with Chrome, data is return it always pad with 0 to make the data become 63 byte long\nand even i check `byteLength`, it also always report 63\nThe problem is my data are reporting in variable length. in Window case, i can't differentiate the 0 is padding or actually my data.\n",
